<title>HONG KONG: China-HK Photo interim net off 12.51 pct.</title>
<headline>China-HK Photo interim net off 12.51 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   10.61  vs  12.19</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    4.3    vs  5.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    106.72 vs  121.98</p>
<p>    Turnover		     868.51 vs  975.69</p>
<p>    Company name		 China-Hongkong Photo Products</p>
<p>				     Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 9-14, 1997</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   February 11, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - China-Hongkong Photo is the distributor of Fuji film in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
